    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reporting progress",
     "texto": [
      "**Stadiu** is \"state\" or \"stage\"; **în desfășurare**, \"in progress\". **Finalizat** describes something finished."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Deadlines",
     "texto": [
      "**Termenul de livrare** means \"the delivery deadline\". **Rămâne** indicates that a forecast is still valid; **depinde de** introduces a pending condition."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
